Tora AI started as a copy of gpt-oss at upstream commit 7b58334 (July 2026) and
has been substantially modified: the reference inference implementations,
harmony-based tools, API server, evals and examples were removed, and a new
chat engine, terminal app and web UI were written. The following files are
adapted from gpt-oss and were changed:

- tora_ai/tools/page_text.py    from gpt_oss/tools/simple_browser/page_contents.py
- tora_ai/tools/web.py          search API usage from gpt_oss/tools/simple_browser/backend.py
- tora_ai/tools/python_exec.py  from gpt_oss/tools/python_docker/docker_tool.py

